  "description": "BIDDUIDDETAILSTRK shows the tracking for the associated object BIDDUIDDETAILS. Together, BIDDUIDDETAILSTRK and BIDDUIDDETAILS define the registration data for each ancillary service a dispatchable unit is registered to provide. The registration data is required to validate a dispatchable unit bid submitted for that ancillary service.",
